COMMENTS.COMMENT:
// Evaluates a single Random Filter condition byte against the current match context.
// Returns 1 if the condition passes, 0 otherwise.
//
// filterByte:
//   0xFF = always true
//   0xFE = opponent is flagged
//   0xFD = opponent is NOT flagged
//   0x00–0x1F = opponent char == ID
//   0x40–0x5F = Story + human-controlled slot + match char
//   0x80–0x9F = Story + CPU-controlled slot + (ID == storyIndex+1)
//   0xC0–0xDF = Story + CPU-controlled slot + match char + progress>2

